An app to help you get a good night's sleep, and meditation sessions to help you relax and explore peace and tranquility.

Subscription:
1. users can only have unlimited access to white noise, meditation courses, sleep logs and other features after they have subscribed through a paid subscription;
2. The subscription fee will be deducted from the user's iTunes account upon confirmation of purchase and can be renewed automatically for $39.99/year;
3. users can turn off auto-renewal 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will be automatically renewed;
4. the Apple ID of the automatically renewed subscription will be automatically deducted from the iTunes account 24 hours before the expiration of each billing cycle and the corresponding validity period will be extended;
5. Users manage the subscription service, i.e., they can go to their user accounts to set off automatic subscriptions after purchase.

User Agreement: https://vciacsoym7.feishu.cn/docx/DTPPde0cDoFd8wxhaJGcz5jOnbh
